## SPLIT GATE
Rule: force-split only if OWN unit >600 (path-A hard ban) or DE-authorized
trivial peel under soft when blocking.

| Unit | Over hard? | Action |
|------|:----------:|--------|
| all R2-touched .oo | no | **none** |
| `main.oo` 307 soft/pack | no hard | residual — DE may later peel import table / dispatch |
| `c_emit` family | was pack@HEAD | **already peeled** this wave |

Suggested DE (when authorized, not this hygiene pass):

1. Optional peel of `main.oo` import-table vs dispatch (drop under 256).
2. Keep multi-import fixtures under `$TMPDIR` via smoke — never `oodac/a.oo`.
3. Scale residual (oodac-tree full check hang) is honesty for peers — not hygiene.

